/// CAPACITY must be a power of two for efficient masking, but this
/// implementation works for any capacity (using % instead of masking).
///
/// The buffer uses separate atomic indices:
///   - `head`: written by producer, read by consumer
///   - `tail`: written by consumer, read by producer
